{"id":"bai-5-xu-ly-input-output-sieu-toc-trong-c-cac-ham-toan-hoc-pho-bien","chapterId":"chuong-1","chapterNumber":1,"chapterTitle":"NHẬP MÔN C++ & KỸ NĂNG SINH TỒN TRONG CONTEST","order":5,"lessonNumber":5,"title":"Bài 5 Xử lý Input, Output siêu tốc trong C++ & Các hàm toán học phổ biến","wordCount":443,"estimatedMinutes":5,"headings":[{"level":2,"text":"1. Tăng tốc I/O trong C++","id":"1-tang-toc-i-o-trong-c"},{"level":2,"text":"Khi cần xuất nhiều dòng","id":"khi-can-xuat-nhieu-dong"},{"level":2,"text":"2. Các hàm toán học phổ biến (&lt;cmath&gt;)","id":"2-cac-ham-toan-hoc-pho-bien-lt-cmath-gt"},{"level":2,"text":"Lưu ý khi dùng số nguyên lớn","id":"luu-y-khi-dung-so-nguyen-lon"},{"level":3,"text":"Ví dụ: tính GCD/LCM","id":"vi-du-tinh-gcd-lcm"}],"contentHtml":"<h2  class=\"mt-10 mb-5 scroll-mt-24 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 font-extrabold text-slate-800 dark:border-white/10 dark:text-slate-100 text-2xl\">1. Tăng tốc I/O trong C++</h2><p class=\"mb-5 leading-8 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\" >Mặc định <code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >cin</code>/<code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >cout</code> khá chậm do đồng bộ với <code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >stdio</code> của C. Thêm đoạn sau vào đầu <code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >main()</code>:</p><div class=\"my-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white shadow-lg dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-[#0d1117]\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-300 bg-slate-100 px-4 py-2 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-[#161b22]\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">cpp · Monokai</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded px-2 py-1 text-xs text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:bg-white/5 dark:hover:text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy h-3.5 w-3.5\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg>Sao chép</button></div><pre style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242); background: rgb(39, 40, 34); text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.875rem; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.75; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1.25rem; margin: 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; max-height: 32rem;\"><code style=\"white-space: pre; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\"><span>ios_base</span><span class=\"token double-colon\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">::</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(230, 219, 116);\">sync_with_stdio</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(174, 129, 255);\">false</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">;</span><span>\n</span><span>cin</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">.</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(230, 219, 116);\">tie</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(249, 38, 114);\">NULL</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">;</span><span>\n</span><span>cout</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">.</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(230, 219, 116);\">tie</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(249, 38, 114);\">NULL</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">;</span></code></pre></div><ul class=\"my-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6\" >\n<li><code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >sync_with_stdio(false)</code>: ngắt đồng bộ giữa <code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >cin/cout</code> và <code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >scanf/printf</code> → tăng tốc đáng kể.</li>\n<li><code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >cin.tie(NULL)</code>: ngắt liên kết tự động flush <code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >cout</code> trước mỗi lần đọc <code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >cin</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"mb-5 leading-8 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\" ><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> sau khi dùng <code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >sync_with_stdio(false)</code>, <strong>không được</strong> trộn lẫn <code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >cin/cout</code> với <code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >scanf/printf</code> trong cùng chương trình.</p><h2  class=\"mt-10 mb-5 scroll-mt-24 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 font-extrabold text-slate-800 dark:border-white/10 dark:text-slate-100 text-2xl\">Khi cần xuất nhiều dòng</h2><p class=\"mb-5 leading-8 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\" >Dùng <code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >\"\\n\"</code> thay vì <code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >endl</code>, vì <code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >endl</code> luôn flush buffer gây chậm:</p><div class=\"my-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-white shadow-lg dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-[#0d1117]\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-300 bg-slate-100 px-4 py-2 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-[#161b22]\"><span class=\"font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\">cpp · Monokai</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded px-2 py-1 text-xs text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200 hover:text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-400 dark:hover:bg-white/5 dark:hover:text-white\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy h-3.5 w-3.5\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg>Sao chép</button></div><pre style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242); background: rgb(39, 40, 34); text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.875rem; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.75; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1.25rem; margin: 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; max-height: 32rem;\"><code style=\"white-space: pre; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\"><span>cout </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">&lt;&lt;</span><span> x </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">&lt;&lt;</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(166, 226, 46);\">\"\\n\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">;</span><span>   </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(130, 146, 162);\">// nhanh</span><span>\n</span><span>cout </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">&lt;&lt;</span><span> x </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">&lt;&lt;</span><span> endl</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(248, 248, 242);\">;</span><span>   </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(130, 146, 162);\">// chậm hơn</span></code></pre></div><h2  class=\"scroll-mt-24 font-extrabold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-5 mt-10 border-b border-slate-200 pb-2 text-2xl dark:border-white/10\">2. Các hàm toán học phổ biến (<code class=\"rounded bg-slate-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[0.9em] text-cyan-700 dark:bg-slate-800 dark:text-cyan-300\" >&lt;cmath&gt;</code>)</h2>\n<div class=\"my-7 w-full overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border border-slate-300 dark:border-slate-700\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[520px] border-collapse text-left text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300\"><thead class=\"bg-slate-100 text-slate-800 dark:bg-[#1b2028] dark:text-slate-100\"><tr class=\"transition-colors even:bg-slate-